Using skills S40 (process updates in generate/doctor), S70 (kept viz/data flow compatible), and S98 (schema/test governance and smoke coverage).

Implemented the PatternBase interface and catalog with enabled flags, moved patterns to normalized coordinates using shared geometry/masks primitives, and updated generate/calibrate_search/doctor to enforce r_norm + label_fine with bounds checks and legacy key mapping. Added new geometry/masks modules, expanded schema to require r_norm/label_fine, refreshed noise to keep r_norm/r_mm consistent, and updated tests plus the new T0503 smoke to validate catalog + bounds.

